  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPledgedAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※３　担保資産及び担保付債務&lt;/p&gt;
